<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS-Superior, Trusted surge.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS-Superior, Trusted surge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superior Consultant Holdings Corp and Trusted Information Systems led the pack of initial public offerings on Wall Street on Thursday.</p>
<p>Health care consulting firm Superior Consultant shares jumped more than thirty percent, up 4-7/8 to 20-7/8 from their IPO price of $16. The shares priced at $16, above their estimated pricing range of $13 to $15.</p>
<p>Trusted Information Systems Inc shares surged almost 28 percent, rising 3-5/8 to 16-5/8 from their $13 a share IPO price.</p>
</text>
